   "file": "TauCeti/Probability/Finance/SimpleStrategy.lean",
   "fix": "Add `simpleGains_of_ge` (`Monotone \u03c4 \u2192 \u03c4 n \u2264 t \u2192 simpleGains \u03c4 n a X t \u03c9 = simpleGains \u03c4 n a X (\u03c4 n) \u03c9`) and a terminal-wealth theorem for self-financing strategies: for `0 < n`, `a (n-1) S(\u03c4 n) + b (n-1) \u03b2(\u03c4 n) = V\u2080 + \u2211_{i<n} a i \u0394S_i + \u2211_{i<n} b i \u0394\u03b2_i`.",
